## Overview
Step-Up SIP allows investors to automatically increase their SIP installment by a predefined percentage (e.g., 10%) or fixed sum (e.g., ₹1,000) every year in tandem with salary increments. This counters lifestyle inflation and supercharges terminal corpus growth.

## Key features
- Automatic annual indexation aligned with employee salary increments
- Cap threshold option (e.g. stop increasing once SIP reaches ₹50,000/month)
- Multiplies 20-year terminal corpus by up to 2.2x compared to a flat SIP
- Seamless bank mandate management without needing a new NACH every year

## Who it suits
Salaried professionals aged 24-45 with regular annual increments seeking aggressive retirement or milestone corpus building.

## Our advantage
FundsIndia was the pioneer of automated Step-Up SIPs in India. Our engine allows date-based, anniversary-based, or manual bump triggers with zero platform transaction fees.

## How to pitch it
Mr. Sharma, if you invest ₹10,000/month for 20 years at 12%, you will accumulate ~₹1 Crore. But if you simply step it up by 10% each year—matching your normal salary raise—your corpus becomes ₹2.25 Crores! You invest 2x more over time, but accumulate more than double the wealth with no extra effort.

