## Daily routine
1. Open **Leads** -> filter *My open leads* -> sort by *Last activity* (oldest first).
2. Work **overdue Tasks** before new leads.
3. After every call: set the **disposition / status**, write a **call note**, and schedule the **next task**.

## A good call note (4 lines)
- **Situation** - who they are, goal, horizon (e.g. "35 y/o, wants Rs 50L for child education in 12 yrs").
- **Need** - what was asked / the concern raised.
- **Agreement** - what you told them and what they agreed to.
- **Next step** - what, who, and *when* (create the Task with a date).

## Lead statuses (typical)
*New -> Attempted to contact -> Contacted -> Qualified -> Converted* or *Not interested / Junk / Not reachable*.
Never leave a lead in "New" after you have called.

## Compliance reminders
- Do not promise returns. Quote only approved material.
- Record consent for communications (WhatsApp/e-mail) in the record.
- Do not store PAN/Aadhaar images in notes - use the approved document flow.',12,1,1) ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET course_id=excluded.course_id,module_id=excluded.module_id,title=excluded.title,kind=excluded.kind,body=excluded.body,minutes=excluded.minutes,published=excluded.published,sort=excluded.sort WHERE lessons.course_id IS NOT excluded.course_id OR lessons.module_id IS NOT excluded.module_id OR lessons.title IS NOT excluded.title OR lessons.kind IS NOT excluded.kind OR lessons.body IS NOT excluded.body OR lessons.minutes IS NOT excluded.minutes OR lessons.published IS NOT excluded.published OR lessons.sort IS NOT excluded.sort;

A **Deal** is an opportunity with an *amount*, *closing date* and *stage*.

## Keep the pipeline honest
- Move the stage only when the **exit criteria** are met (e.g. "KYC complete" before "Ready to invest").
- Update **amount** and **closing date** every time they change - forecasts are built from these.
- Use **Lost reason** when closing as lost; it is the most valuable data for improving the pitch.

## Views that save time
- **Kanban view** of the pipeline for stand-ups.
- **Custom views**: "Closing this week", "No activity in 7 days".
- **Reports/Dashboards**: conversion by source, calls per day, pipeline by owner.

## Weekly hygiene (15 minutes, every Friday)
1. Every open deal has a **next task**.
2. No deal has a **past closing date**.
3. Stale deals (>14 days no activity) are either re-engaged or closed.',8,1,2) ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET course_id=excluded.course_id,module_id=excluded.module_id,title=excluded.title,kind=excluded.kind,body=excluded.body,minutes=excluded.minutes,published=excluded.published,sort=excluded.sort WHERE lessons.course_id IS NOT excluded.course_id OR lessons.module_id IS NOT excluded.module_id OR lessons.title IS NOT excluded.title OR lessons.kind IS NOT excluded.kind OR lessons.body IS NOT excluded.body OR lessons.minutes IS NOT excluded.minutes OR lessons.published IS NOT excluded.published OR lessons.sort IS NOT excluded.sort;

Zoho CRM can automate repetitive steps. Your admin configures these; you should know how they affect you.

- **Email / WhatsApp templates** - use only approved templates; placeholders (client name, scheme) are filled from the record, so keep the record clean.
- **Workflow rules** - e.g. auto-create a follow-up task when a lead moves to *Contacted*.
- **Blueprint** - forces a fixed process (you cannot skip steps) and may require notes or documents at a step.
- **Assignment rules** - new leads are routed to owners automatically.
- **Reminders** - tasks trigger notifications; clear them daily.

## If something looks wrong
Do not work around it. Raise it with your admin with: the record link, what you expected, what happened, and a screenshot.',8,1,3) ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET course_id=excluded.course_id,module_id=excluded.module_id,title=excluded.title,kind=excluded.kind,body=excluded.body,minutes=excluded.minutes,published=excluded.published,sort=excluded.sort WHERE lessons.course_id IS NOT excluded.course_id OR lessons.module_id IS NOT excluded.module_id OR lessons.title IS NOT excluded.title OR lessons.kind IS NOT excluded.kind OR lessons.body IS NOT excluded.body OR lessons.minutes IS NOT excluded.minutes OR lessons.published IS NOT excluded.published OR lessons.sort IS NOT excluded.sort;
